data: {"id": "f99cac2185bc4dfb-thinking-parallel_evidence-1747", "run_id": "f99cac2185bc4dfb", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n### Kubernetes 状态\n- **Pod aiops-case-v13/workload 当前 STATUS = Terminating**，但 **phase=Running**，容器状态仍为 Running，Ready=True，restarts=0。\n- **deletionTimestamp = 2026-09-14T08:22:55Z**（距今约 60 分钟，即约 3600 秒）。\n- **terminationGracePeriodSeconds = 3900 秒**（65 分钟）。\n- **deletionGracePeriodSeconds = 3900**。\n- **finalizers = <none>** — 无 finalizer 阻塞。\n- 容器启动命令为 Python：收到 SIGTERM 后打印 \"SIGTERM received; waiting\"，然后等待 `/state/teardown-requested` 文件出现才退出。\n- **EmptyDir 卷 `state`**，无需 CSI detach/unmount。", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1789370338921, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

